{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nox Mortalis is a retro-style open world survival game where you must gather resources, craft essential gear, and explore sinister dungeons. Face hellish creatures and fight to survive through the night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a rewarding sense of progression and has intense horror elements, keeping players on edge as they delve deeper into this nightmarish world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520400/extras/steam_gameplay_gif.gif?t=1746819207\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PS1 aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day/Night system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore survival horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cave/dungeon exploration</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520400?t=1746819207","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520400?t=1746819207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520400/983af8cfa024008898ecda1f43e9ee830298bf6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746819207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520400/983af8cfa024008898ecda1f43e9ee830298bf6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746819207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nox Mortalis is a retro-style open world survival game where you must gather resources, craft essential gear, and explore sinister dungeon